## 5. Session Routine

### At Session Start

```bash
# Check state
git status -sb
cat Plans.md
head -50 AGENTS.md
```

Or type "session start" to launch the skill.

### When Work Is Complete

```bash
# Commit (follow convention)
git add -A
git commit -m "feat: [description of change]"
git push

# Completion report
/handoff-to-cursor
```

